            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100000
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "send_feedback",
      "description": "Report a problem or a gap to the Crushy team: results that didn't fit the request, a search you couldn't express with the filters, a confusing error, a missing feature, or a bug. Include what your person asked for in context. Free; read by humans and used to improve search.",
